<sect1 id="chapter7_1autotoc_md166_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter7_1autotoc_md166">
<title>Normalization flow</title><para>Load a manifest from JSON, YAML, S-expression, or XML. Convert it into <computeroutput>PackageManifest</computeroutput> with consistent field names and semantics. Re-emit canonical JSON for inspection or registry use.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">auto<sp/>mf<sp/>=<sp/>sattyre::load_manifest(&quot;share/packages/demo/manifest.json&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">std::string<sp/>canonical<sp/>=<sp/>sattyre::manifest_to_json(mf);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">std::cout<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>canonical<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>&quot;\n&quot;;</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
