<sect1 id="chapter7_1autotoc_md168_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter7_1autotoc_md168">
<title>Manifest tests</title><para>Positive tests for valid manifests. Negative tests for missing name/version/type. Malformed document tests for each supported parser path.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>-S<sp/>.<sp/>-B<sp/>build/manifest<sp/>-DSATTYRE_ENABLE_TESTS=ON</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>--build<sp/>build/manifest<sp/>-j</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ctest<sp/>--test-dir<sp/>build/manifest<sp/>-R<sp/>sattyre-manifest-test<sp/>--output-on-failure</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
